---
description: Conventional Commits enforced by commitlint
alwaysApply: true
---

Full rules: @docs/CONVENTIONS.md

Format:

```
<type>(<scope>): <subject>
```

- `type`: `feat | fix | chore | docs | refactor | test | perf | ci | build | style | revert`
- `scope`: `web | api | ui | eslint-config | typescript-config | deps | repo`
- `subject`: imperative mood, lowercase, no trailing period, under 72 chars.

The commit-msg hook calls `commitlint` and rejects anything that doesn't match. Never bypass with `--no-verify`.
